# Copy to supabase/functions/.env (git ignores it) and put your own key after the "=". The local Supabase reads this
# file on `supabase start`. Never commit the real file or paste the key into a chat. See docs/HUMAN_TODO.md "Phase 8".
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional (defaults are in supabase/config.toml [edge_runtime.secrets]; production: `supabase secrets set NAME=value`):
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# AI_DAILY_REQUEST_LIMIT=60
# PORTAL_URL=https://<your-portal>.vercel.app   (the only website allowed to call the functions from a browser)
# The database address and keys the functions use are provided by Supabase itself (createSupabaseContext); never set them here.
